{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊疏云：六處殊勝，名為種子。如《地持》說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如《十地論》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「如是」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「無我無我」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「無壽命無壽命」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「失失」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「燒燒」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「破破」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「有為」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云「除殺生」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《正法念經》云：一戶九億"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法藏師云：未見聖教。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此無譯者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輕罪名餘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "末終"}
